<title>USA: Heartland Partners closes building pact.</title>
<headline>Heartland Partners closes building pact.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Partners LP said its subsidiary CMC Heartland Partners V LLC sealed its agreement to become the exclusive homebuilder for Osprey Cove Inc in St. Marys, Georgia.</p>
<p>In a release dated January 8, the company said it expected to build about 300 homes in the 550-unit community, with the majority priced from $175,000 to $200,000.</p>
<p>CMC's construction operations there will be named Lifestyle at Osprey Cove, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
